#: runexe/frontend/ui/dialog-proton-alert.blp:35
msgid ""
"Beware, using Proton-based runners in non-Steam capsules can cause problems "
"and prevent them from behaving correctly.\n"
"\n"
"We recommend using Wine-GE rather, a version of Proton meant to run outside "
"of Steam.\n"
"\n"
"Proceeding will automatically enable the Steam runtime (if present in the "
"system and detected by RunExe) in order to allow it to access the necessary "
"libraries and limit compatibility problems. Be aware that GloriousEggroll, "
"the runner's provider, is not responsible for any problems and we ask that "
"you do not report to them."
msgstr ""
"請注意，在非 Steam 的酒瓶裡使用基於 Proton 的執行器可能會造成問題，使其無法正"
"常運作。\n"
"\n"
"我們建議改用 Wine-GE，一個為在 Steam 環境外執行而修改過的 Proton 版本。\n"
"\n"
"如果繼續，RunExe 將會自動啟用 Steam 執行環境（除非 RunExe 偵測不到或是它沒"
"有安裝），來確保 Proton 能使用它需要的函式庫並降低相容性問題發生的機率。也請"
"注意提供這個執行器的人，GloriousEggroll，不負任何問題的責任，並請不要將問題回"
"報給他。"

